{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36642","headline":"秋日酬张特玄 · 罗隐","name":"秋日酬张特玄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病寄南徐两度秋，故人依约亦扬州。\n偶因鴈足思闲事，拟棹孤舟访旧游。\n风急几闻江上笛，月高谁共酒家楼。\n平生意气消磨尽，甘露轩前看水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}